.TH KANBAN 1 "August 2026" "kanban" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kanban \- local orchestration board runtime for coding agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kanban
.RI [ --port " " number|auto ]
.RI [ --no-open ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kanban
starts the local Kanban runtime server and serves the web UI.
When launched inside a Git repository, it opens that repository's indexed workspace.
.PP
Kanban does not expose task, notification, or log subcommands. Agent task lifecycle
operations are provided by the separate Kanban MCP package in the
.B llm-capability
repository. Urgent notifications are provided by the separate
.B notify-user-mac
MCP.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --port <number|auto>
Bind to a specific local port or pick the first available port starting at 3484.
.TP
.B --no-open
Do not open the browser automatically.
.TP
.B --help, -h
Show help text and exit.
.TP
.B --version, -v
Show version and exit.
.SH INTERNAL HELPERS
.B kanban-hooks
is an internal runtime-hook helper installed alongside Kanban. It is not an
agent-facing task interface.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR npm (1)
